Subject: [PATCH 06/11] Show next-workspace overview apps during live swipe.

Keep transition workspaces force-rendered with full alpha so Hyprland emits their clients while sliding, and raise the overview swipe step cap so follow-finger feels less sticky.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
